[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2161.43, "timestamp": "00:36:01", "text": "送了我香水。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2164.15, "timestamp": "00:36:04", "text": "是的，他确实这么做了。是的。正是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2168.47, "timestamp": "00:36:08", "text": "他身上的香水味。奇怪的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2170.47, "timestamp": "00:36:10", "text": "我要抢走那张纸条，把它塞进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2171.829, "timestamp": "00:36:11", "text": "它们的嘴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2175.829, "timestamp": "00:36:15", "text": "谢谢。这至少算是一种不错的处置方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2178.63, "timestamp": "00:36:18", "text": "你确定要吃那个吗？它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2185.109, "timestamp": "00:36:25", "text": "他吃石头。你真的这么认为吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2188.31, "timestamp": "00:36:28", "text": "是否令人担忧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.95, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "可能不会。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2194.15, "timestamp": "00:36:34", "text": "杰克的身体状况非常好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2195.99, "timestamp": "00:36:35", "text": "好的。是的。是的。还有，这种气味就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2197.99, "timestamp": "00:36:37", "text": "大概是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2198.95, "timestamp": "00:36:38", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2200.63, "timestamp": "00:36:40", "text": "如果你想追踪气味，可以跟着它走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2201.67, "timestamp": "00:36:41", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2203.75, "timestamp": "00:36:43", "text": "你循着香味而来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2205.91, "timestamp": "00:36:45", "text": "我知道。爱莉安娜大概会说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2207.43, "timestamp": "00:36:47", "text": "“是啊，我们去见见对方队伍吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2208.87, "timestamp": "00:36:48", "text": "他们是如何做到的呢？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2209.43, "timestamp": "00:36:49", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2211.43, "timestamp": "00:36:51", "text": "闻闻地板。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2213.43, "timestamp": "00:36:53", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2215.27, "timestamp": "00:36:55", "text": "当我闻到那股该死的气味时，我就要到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2217.03, "timestamp": "00:36:57", "text": "最后，你会想：“这是什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2218.15, "timestamp": "00:36:58", "text": "有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2219.91, "timestamp": "00:36:59", "text": "地上有黏糊糊的东西。"}]